AUDIO: 'Want to create an AI video that actually keeps the same face consistent in every single frame? Most AI tools cannot do that. By the end of the clip, the face has slowly turned into someone else. It happens with almost every tool out there. This new Laura from LTX just'

[00:14] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'fixed that problem. It is called Best Face ID and it comes from a creator named Alison Orks. As you can see in this video, the girl\'s face stays consistent across every frame. I pulled'

[00:26] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'this straight into Comfy UI and put it to the real test. on why this actually works before we jump in. Most identity tools just paste a face onto a generated frame, which is why it slowly drifts'

[00:40] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'into someone else. This Laura uses overlap reference conditioning along with an Arc Face Identity Loss, which is the same technology used in facial recognition, to keep pulling the'

[00:52] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'generated face back toward the real reference. That is why the result holds up so much better. So, let\'s start Comfy UI. Over here, you can see we will take this girl right here and this is the'

